{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06812","headline":"同王维集青龙寺昙壁上人兄院五韵 · 王昌龄","name":"同王维集青龙寺昙壁上人兄院五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本来清净所，竹树引幽阴。\n檐外含山翠，人间出世心。\n圆通无有象，圣境不能侵。\n真是吾兄法，何妨友弟深。\n天香自然会，灵异识钟音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}